{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02961","headline":"奉和圣制次成皐先圣擒建德之所 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制次成皐先圣擒建德之所","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天命诚有集，王业初惟艰。\n翦商自文祖，夷项在兹山。\n地识斩蛇处，河临饮马间。\n威加昔运往，泽流今圣还。\n尊祖颂先烈，赓歌安用攀。\n绍成即我后，封岱出天关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02961.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02961","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}